      },
      "message": "fix(ui): compute a chain selection's geometry once, not on each frame\n\nA still frame with chains in an operation's selection took 0.4-1.6 s.\nEach frame content-hashed the facets, walked all the model's chains for\neach chain and each caller, and sliced the part at each ladder plane for\neach of three region_of calls.\n\n- model::features_of_shared: features keyed by the facet Arc allocation.\n- model::resolve_chain: chain lookup memo keyed by the Arc<Features>\n  allocation; all callers of feature::resolve_chain take it.\n- operation::pocket_memo: the pocket region on a part, keyed by its\n  exact input (loops, facets, planes, unit); refusals are kept too.\n- ui frame_memo::scene_scope: one region_of per operation per scene.\n\nA still frame is now about 6 ms headless on fig8.step.\n\nFixes #2235\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
